  "sourceTitle": "A Summer Drink",
  "sourceText": "A Summer Drink\nBy: lauresophie\nPublished: Tuesday, August 10, 2010 - 8:21am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 melon (cold)\n6 mint leaves\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cut the melon in half and take away the seeds. Peel it and put the pulp in a blender. 2 Wash the mint leaves. Add it i the blender. 3 Mix until it gets liquid. 4 Serve it cold possibly!",
